You may use, modify, and distribute this core software under the terms of the AGPLv3, which requires that any derivative works and services built upon it also be open-sourced under the AGPLv3.

2. Commercial License
Certain "Enterprise Features" are proprietary and require a valid Commercial License. These features include, but are not limited to:
